    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_array_ref" kindref="compound">ArrayRef</ref> is not really compatible with the YAMLTraits. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Everything should be immutable in an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_array_ref" kindref="compound">ArrayRef</ref>, while the <ref refid="structllvm_1_1yaml_1_1_sequence_traits" kindref="compound">SequenceTraits</ref> expect a mutable version for inputting, but we&apos;re only using the outputting capabilities here. This is a hack, but still nicer than having to manually call the YAMLIO internal methods. Keep this in this file so that it doesn&apos;t get misused from <ref refid="_y_a_m_l_traits_8h" kindref="compound">YAMLTraits.h</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
